|t=The speaker should '''face toward''' the deaf people so that they can see her mouth when she is talking.}}
# to [[desire]]
# to [[incline]] towards something, to [[favour]]

===Noun===
{{mi-noun}}

# [[front]] {{gloss|facing side}}
